{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>由江美儀領軍，夥拍張振朗、朱敏瀚、吳業坤及曾展望組成的「試真D團隊」，在第5集節目中，江美儀、張振朗與吳業坤來到高雄前金區，實測一間榮獲米芝蓮推介的台式餐廳。這間餐廳雖然極具人氣，但網上卻流傳不少關於其「規矩多」的討論，到底是否值得一試？</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0427d4f7-e328-4b65-bb53-3c64064a9ef3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026mSGT2Exs351791281049.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0427d4f7-e328-4b65-bb53-3c64064a9ef3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>這間摘星台式餐廳可謂極難預約，食客甚至需要提早整整一個月「搶位」。餐廳每天僅營業兩個時段，每段用餐時間限制為一個半小時，每週更固定休息兩天。甫踏入店內，便能聽到店家奔放熱情的招呼聲，而牆上亦貼有「請勿遲到」的溫馨提示。</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>雖然網上評價高達 4.5 分，食客大讚菜式富有靈魂與層次，但同時亦存在一些令人啼笑皆非的「負評」。原來，直率的老闆娘極度疼愛身為主廚的兒子，不希望他過度勞累，因此會希望客人多點副廚主理的菜式，並嚴格限制客人「不能加點」。</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>翻開菜單，附有笑臉標記的均是大受好評的熱門菜式（如元蹄等）。然而，菜單上竟有一道標註著「難吃」的梅乾扣肉。老闆娘親自解畫，坦言「難吃」意指這道菜並非人人都能接受，猶如榴槤一樣，因其採用傳統原發酵風味，完全不加甜味，口感偏鹹。這種「高級的難吃」反而激發了三位主持的挑戰慾，決定點來一試。</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>菜式陸續上桌，賣相與味道皆展現出極高水準：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li></ul><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cad89f65-12eb-45dc-a88e-ed52f2adb0e8.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026PLYtIXJtB31791281049.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cad89f65-12eb-45dc-a88e-ed52f2adb0e8.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f7ac4979-9265-45bf-9168-28c40ec539fd.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026VtZ1yH62X31791281049.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f7ac4979-9265-45bf-9168-28c40ec539fd.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f9807c76-c7fd-42b2-8ed0-5164089d9ac7.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026PLQ31mBqJS1791281050.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f9807c76-c7fd-42b2-8ed0-5164089d9ac7.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a3c7aa11-f703-4382-a86c-d49bc6ca195f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026JG4jHF4GiU1791281050.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a3c7aa11-f703-4382-a86c-d49bc6ca195f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>用餐途中，主持們嘗試向老闆娘爭取加菜，老闆娘依然笑著婉拒，並幽默地回應：「你們現在坐著胃被壓住，等一下站起來就脹滿了。」</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>雖然限制特別，但老闆娘有問有答、充滿煙火氣的互動成為了一大亮點。最終整桌菜餚被全數吃光，一餐消費約 $3,400 新台幣（約港幣 $844），以當地消費而言不算便宜。但憑藉其精緻廚藝、新鮮食材及米芝蓮光環，整體表現依然相當划算且值得一試。主持們最後更給予了 4.67 分（5分滿分）的高分評價。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T13:20:03.217463+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":714,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}